+//! GoNotoCurrent font has them) and right-to-left runs are reversed.
+//! Lines without RTL characters are returned unchanged (borrowed, no cost).
+//!
+//! This is a compact subset of the Unicode bidi algorithm: one paragraph
+//! level from the first strong character, digits keep their order, brackets
+//! are mirrored inside RTL runs. Good for UI labels and chat lines.
